  "adaptations": [
    "Only the standalone Kitty graphics module is included.",
    "Imports use explicit .ts paths and the isolated APC-capable Claude terminal xterm dependency.",
    "KittyOptions is copied from the upstream interface without unrelated terminal types.",
    "Pinned xterm ambient declarations use the npm alias module name; no API types are changed.",
    "Per-image decode tokens prevent older asynchronous PNG/RGBA decodes from replacing later transmissions or reviving deleted/reset/evicted images.",
    "Screen erase clears physical placements and placeholder cells but retains Unicode virtual prototypes, as required for native resize redraws.",
    "Matching MIT FitAddon source uses the isolated terminal type and the published bundle default scrollbar width (14); its redundant package API interface is omitted."
